# Variables de entorno para VS Code REST Client
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@apiKey = dev-key
@sandboxPath = ./sandbox

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Procesar carpetas (ALLOW)
# Procesa las subcarpetas dentro de {{sandboxPath}}.
# Por defecto, el proyecto permite rutas dentro de ./sandbox
# y eliminará las subcarpetas válidas encontradas.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/folders/process
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "action": "ALLOW",
  "path": "{{sandboxPath}}"
}

### Procesar carpetas (DENY)
# Igual que el anterior, pero registrando la acción como DENY.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/folders/process
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "action": "DENY",
  "path": "{{sandboxPath}}"
}

### Scrape 1001Tracklists para DJs configurados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracklists/1001/scrape
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}


### Scrape extractor por defecto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracklist_extractor/scrape
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Scrape extractor con limite e ignorando last_title implicitamente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tracklist_extractor/scrape?limit=2
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

